="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A61">Coming soon</span></div> <div><div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#F4F4F5;margin-bottom:12px">{% render 'wt-img', img: section.settings.burger_image, label: 'Burger art', fit: 'contain' %}<span style="position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:#101012;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px">Oct 15</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px"><span style="font-weight:500;font-size:16px">Knead That Burger</span><span style="font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em">$20</span></div><span style="font-size:13px;color:#5A5A61">Coming soon</span></div> </div> </section> <section id="bubble" style="background:#F4F4F5;margin-top:64px"> <div style="max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 32px"> <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:32px"> <div> <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D71920">Never runs out</p> <h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Jost','Century Gothic',Futura,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:52px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:lowercase">endless bubble wrap</h2> </div> <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A5A61;max-width:44ch">Pop it, flip it, pop it again. Two sizes: the 2Go blind bag to clip on a backpack, or the full size in six colors.</p> </div> {% render 'wt-bubble' %} </div> </section> <section id="tagd" style="max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:72px 32px 8px"> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center"> <div> <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D71920">Works with Apple AirTag</p> <h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Jost','Century Gothic',Futura,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:52px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:lowercase">tag'd 2</h2> <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A5A61;max-width:46ch">A slap watch with a pocket for an AirTag, so you can find it on the bus, at school, or wherever it ended up. Kids set the time themselves. AirTag sold separately.</p> <div style="display:grid;gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px;max-width:44ch"> <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:#101012;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span><span style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Drop an AirTag into the pocket on the band.</span></div> <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:#101012;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span><span style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Slap it on. One size, no buckles, no help needed.</span></div> <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:#D71920;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span><span style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5">Find it in the Find My app when it goes missing.</span></div> </div> <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap"> <a href="/collections/tagd" style="background:#D71920;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:6px">Shop Tag'd &mdash; {{ p_tagd.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | default: '$30' }}</a> </div> </div> <div style="position:relative;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#101012;aspect-ratio:4/3">{% if p_tagd.featured_image %}<img src="{{ p_tagd.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="{{ p_tagd.title }}" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:8%">{% endif %}</div> </div> {% assign tagd_col = collections['tagd'] %} <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:36px"> {% for product in tagd_col.products limit: 6 %} <a href="{{ product.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit"><div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#F4F4F5;margin-bottom:10px"><img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ product.title }}" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:8%"></div><span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:500">{{ product.title | split: ' - ' | first }}</span></a> {% endfor %} </div> </section> {% render 'wt-play' %} <section style="max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 32px"> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;border-top:1px solid #E2E2E4;padding-top:40px"> <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">Tested and certified kid-safe</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A5A61">Every product we make is safety tested and certified. Test reports and CPCs on file.</p></div> <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">Orders over $20 ship free</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A5A61">Two fidgets clear it. So does one watch.</p></div> <div><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">Find a local reseller</h3><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A5A61">Prefer to shop in person? We're carried in stores nationwide.</p><a href="/pages/find-a-store" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#D71920">Find a store</a></div> </div> </section> <section style="background:#F4F4F5"> <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 32px;text-align:center"> <h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Jost','Century Gothic',Futura,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-transform:lowercase">new drops, first look</h2> <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;color:#5A5A61">New fidgets land a few times a year and sell through fast.</p> {% form 'customer' %} {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#101012">Thanks &mdash; you're on the list.</p>{% else %} <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"> <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"> <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Email" required style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;font-size:16px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #E2E2E4;border-radius:6px;min-width:300px;background:#fff"> <button type="submit" style="font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif;background:#D71920;color:#fff;border:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer">Subscribe</button> </div> {% endif %} {% endform %} </div> </section> </div> {% schema %} { "name": "Watchitude home", "settings": [ { "type": "header", "content": "Photos still needed" }, { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Hero image (defaults to sushi product photo)" }, { "type": "image_picker", "id": "ice_image", "label": "Knead That Ice Cream art" }, { "type": "image_picker", "id": "burger_image", "label": "Knead That Burger art" }, { "type": "image_picker", "id": "twogo_image", "label": "Endless Bubble 2Go (falls back to product photo)" }, { "type": "image_picker", "id": "new_image", "label": "Click-Key Blocks (SKU 740)" }, { "type": "header", "content": "Just landed band" }, { "type": "textarea", "id": "new_copy", "label": "Click-Key Blocks description", "default": "Clicky mechanical keys you can pull apart and snap back together. Quiet enough for the classroom, loud enough to be worth it." } ], "presets": [{ "name": "Watchitude home" }] } {% endschema %}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ============================================================
     Watchitude home
     Tunable tokens live here. Adjust these, not the rules below.
     Scoped to .wt-section so nothing leaks into the rest of the
     theme (this CSS is bundled into the shared styles.css).
     ============================================================ */
  .wt-section {
    --wt-section-max: 1400px;
    --wt-section-pad-x: 32px;
    --wt-section-pad-top: 32px;
    --wt-section-pad-bottom: 8px;

    --wt-card-radius: 14px;
    --wt-card-gap: 20px;
    --wt-btn-radius: 6px;

    --wt-font-display: 'Jost', 'Century Gothic', Futura, sans-serif;
    --wt-red: #D71920;
    --wt-ink: #101012;
    --wt-mist: #F4F4F5;
    --wt-line: #E2E2E4;
    --wt-muted: #5A5A61;

    max-width: var(--wt-section-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--wt-section-pad-top) var(--wt-section-pad-x) var(--wt-section-pad-bottom);
  }

  /* ---------- hero: layout ---------- */
  .wt-hero__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--wt-card-gap);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .wt-hero__side {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--wt-card-gap);
  }

  /* ---------- hero: shared media layer ---------- */
  .wt-hero__media {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .wt-hero__media--dim {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .wt-hero__img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* ---------- hero: feature panel ---------- */
  .wt-hero__feature {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--wt-card-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--wt-mist);
    min-height: 560px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .wt-hero__overlay {
    position: relative;
    pointer-events: none;
    padding: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0.92) 0%,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0.8) 62%,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0) 100%
    );
  }

  .wt-hero__title {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-family: var(--wt-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 15ch;
  }

  .wt-hero__lead {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 46ch;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .wt-hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .wt-hero__pill {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border-radius: var(--wt-btn-radius);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }

  .wt-hero__price {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  /* ---------- hero: side cards ---------- */
  .wt-hero__card {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--wt-card-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--wt-mist);
    min-height: 270px;
    display: flex;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .wt-hero__card--dark {
    background: var(--wt-ink);
  }

  .wt-hero__card-overlay {
    position: relative;
    pointer-events: none;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0.92) 0%,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0.78) 60%,
      rgba(16, 16, 18, 0) 100%
    );
    width: 100%;
  }

  .wt-hero__card-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--wt-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .wt-hero__card-copy {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  /* ---------- shared: eyebrow + primary button ---------- */
  .wt-hero__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .wt-hero__eyebrow--feature {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .wt-btn {
    background: var(--wt-red);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 15px 26px;
    border-radius: var(--wt-btn-radius);
  }

  .wt-btn--nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     "Just landed" band  (#new)
     Section padding matches the .wt-section defaults, so there is
     no --wt-section-pad-* override here.
     ============================================================ */
  .wt-new {
    --wt-new-media-width: 340px;
    --wt-new-gap: 32px;
  }

  .wt-new__card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--wt-new-media-width) 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--wt-new-gap);
    align-items: center;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--wt-line);
    border-radius: var(--wt-card-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .wt-new__media {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16/11;
    background: var(--wt-mist);
  }

  .wt-new__img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    padding: 8%;
  }

  .wt-new__body {
    padding: 26px 0;
  }

  .wt-new__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--wt-red);
  }

  .wt-new__title {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--wt-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 38px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .wt-new__copy {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
